melonDS DS on GLES 3.2: lets the GL renderer build against GLES3 (with patches/melonds.patch on the melonDS
dependency), requests a GLES 3.2 context, ports the compositor shaders to GLSL ES 3.00, and keeps glsm and the
frontend clear of melonDS VAO state. Applied to cores/src/melondsds.

